# Patient Management Information System (PMIS)

## ERD Diagram

```mermaid
erDiagram

PATIENT {
    string patient_id PK
    string full_name
    int age
    string gender
    string diagnosis
    double consultation_fee
    date registration_date
}

GUARDIAN {
    int guardian_id PK
    string full_name
    string phone
    string relationship
}

PATIENT_GUARDIAN {
    int id PK
    string patient_id FK
    int guardian_id FK
}

PATIENT ||--o{ PATIENT_GUARDIAN : has
GUARDIAN ||--o{ PATIENT_GUARDIAN : linked_to
```
